{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝（Move Free 7-in-1 Total Mobility Care）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$136，約23%。</p>\n<h2>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝｜單盒網店價一覽</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$458</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$458</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝｜選購與包裝</h2>\n<p>買一盒的話，HKTVmall列出HK$458，較表列次低標價HK$594少HK$136。選購時可按外盒核對7合1配方及240粒規格，並留意大包裝的有效期。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月19日商戶網上報價。價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源<a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/FLY/s/B1285002/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E9%AA%A8%E9%AA%BC-%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-7%E5%90%881-%E8%A3%9C%E9%AA%A8%E5%81%A5%E8%82%8C%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E5%85%A8%E6%95%88%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9-240%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/B1285002_S_JK9706\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/move-free-7-in-1-total-mobility-care-joints-bones-muscle-240pcs/p/694133\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-7%E5%90%881%E8%A3%9C%E9%AA%A8.%E5%81%A5%E8%82%8C.%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E5%85%A8%E6%95%88%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9240%E7%B2%92/p/BP_264360\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a></p>\n<p>香港產品資料列出葡萄糖胺、軟骨素、MSM、鈣及維他命D。維他命D有助人體吸收鈣質。如對成分或服用有疑問，可先請教醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。資料來源<a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/move-free-7-in-1-total-mobility-care-joints-bones-muscle-240pcs/p/694133\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧香港產品資料</a><a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminD-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS 維他命D資料</a><a href=\"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/glucosamine-and-chondroitin-for-osteoarthritis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NCCIH 葡萄糖胺與軟骨素資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（HK$594－HK$458）÷HK$594×100%，約23%。以上為表列同規格單盒標價的比較，未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502699601282040_17756224426afdf034d503e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝｜HKTVmall HK$458，同款單盒價差約23%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502699601282040_17756224426afdf034d503e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較規格為每盒240粒。購買前請核對實物標籤、包裝及商戶條款。</p>\n<p>服用華法林人士要留意甚麼？<i></i></p>\n<p>NCCIH指，葡萄糖胺及軟骨素與華法林合用可能增加出血風險。正在服用華法林的人士應先請教醫生或藥劑師。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:44:31.899368+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":737,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:36:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:57:54.943621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:38:01.265646+00:00","content_hash":"c1e9efe450fc4b1dadfbcb245b69e7f7f280123e8a5185fb61427b95906f8819","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}